Package: jwdid.r
Title: Extended Two-Way Fixed Effects Difference-in-Differences with PPML
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Yutaro", "Kimata", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "mocaboo1@gmail.com")
Description: An unofficial R implementation of the PPML path of the Stata
    command 'jwdid'. Estimates staggered difference-in-differences models using
    Poisson pseudo-maximum likelihood with fixed effects through 'fixest'.
    Implements treatment-cell construction and average treatment effect
    aggregation following the Stata command 'jwdid', including gravity
    specifications with dyad and exporter-time and importer-time fixed effects.
    Provides clustered delta-method inference and event-study plots.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.0.0)
Imports:
    fixest (>= 0.14.1),
    graphics,
    stats,
    utils
